...@_theme
direction: right

A: "Official AIMModel\nspec.image: aim-llama:0.9.0" {class: user}
B: "Deployable profile definitions\naimId=meta-llama/Llama-3-8B-Instruct\nall discovered hardware variants" {class: managed}
C: "Fine-tune AIMModel\nspec.profiles.derivedFrom..." {class: user}
D: "Deployable AIMProfiles\naimId inherited\nmodelSources overridden" {class: managed}
E: AIMService {class: resolved}

A -> B: publishes definitions
B -> C: selected by
C -> D: emits deployable profiles
D -> E: backs
